# The Power ISA 3.1C specification is 375 MB and the e200z759 core
# reference manual 7.6 MB. Same argument as docs/renesas: both are vendor
# downloads one link away rather than anything this repo produces, and a
# blob that size is permanent and unshrinkable once it is in the history.
# The e200z7 core reference manual beside them is small and is tracked, in
# line with docs/arm and docs/st.
#
#   https://openpowerfoundation.org/specifications/isa/
#
# The names below are the files as they actually land from those links.
# Check that with `git status` after adding one: the entry that matches
# nothing is the failure mode this file already has a scar from.
OPF_PowerISA_v3.1c.pdf
e200z759CRM.pdf
